    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a pointing constraint of one axis of the spacecraft along a user defined, tabulated pointing profile in the ECI frame. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Unlike the pre-defined target types above, the target is fully user defined: the profile is provided up front (must be known beforehand) and interpolated at each instant. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
